## Grafik Bileşeni Kuralları

### MetricChart (Recharts)
```tsx
// CPU/RAM/Disk zaman serisi — her zaman bu yapıyı kullan
<ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={200}>
  <AreaChart data={metrics}>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="colorCpu" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
        <stop offset="5%" stopColor="#3b82f6" stopOpacity={0.3} />
        <stop offset="95%" stopColor="#3b82f6" stopOpacity={0} />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" stroke="#f0f0f0" />
    <XAxis dataKey="recorded_at" tickFormatter={formatTime} />
    <YAxis domain={[0, 100]} unit="%" />
    <Tooltip formatter={(v) => `${v}%`} />
    <Area
      type="monotone"
      dataKey="cpu_percent"
      stroke="#3b82f6"
      fill="url(#colorCpu)"
    />
  </AreaChart>
</ResponsiveContainer>
```

- `ResponsiveContainer` zorunlu — sabit piksel width kullanma
- `domain={[0, 100]}` yüzde metriklerinde her zaman belirt
- Tooltip'te değeri formatla (% veya MB/GB)
- Renk paleti: CPU=blue, RAM=purple, Disk=orange, Network=green

### MetricGauge
- Basit dairesel progress: `<CircularProgressbar>` veya Recharts `RadialBarChart`
- Kritik eşik aşıldığında kırmızı, uyarı eşiğinde sarı, normal yeşil

